{
 "generator": "build_prisms.py",
 "head": "259efa7",
 "fragments": {
  "angle-pipeline": {
   "title": "The ANGLE pipeline",
   "note": "repo state \u2192 signal \u2192 one line \u2192 satellite \u00b7 autoplays, own controls",
   "html": "<div class=\"pxfrag px-angle-pipeline\" data-prism-fragment=\"angle-pipeline\"><div class=\"pxhead\"><span class=\"pxtitle\">The ANGLE pipeline</span><span class=\"pxnote\">repo state \u2192 signal \u2192 one line \u2192 satellite \u00b7 autoplays, own controls</span></div><div class=\"pxbody\"><!-- FRAGMENT \u2014 embeddable, and therefore deliberately small: four machines, one\n     row, no prose. It carries no nav entry (a fragment with one is a page) and\n     it autoplays with its own scrub bar, per the operator's ruling that a\n     component behaves the same standalone as embedded. -->\n<div class=\"pfwrap\"><div class=\"pfsize\"><div class=\"pffit\"><div class=\"pf\" data-prism data-fx=\"angle\" data-tick=\"1300\" style=\"--pf-node-w:154px;--pf-hop-w:108px\">\n  <div class=\"pf-belt\">\n\n    <button class=\"pf-node\" data-node=\"repo state\" data-in=\"the working tree\" data-out=\"7 probe results\"\n            data-num=\"7 signals\" data-state=\"running\" data-detail=\"#d-a1\">\n      <span class=\"pf-ix\">1</span><span class=\"pf-name\">repo state</span>\n      <span class=\"pf-recipe\"><i>in</i><span>the working tree</span><i>out</i><span>7 probe results</span></span>\n      <span class=\"pf-num\">7 signals \u00b7 S1\u2013S7</span>\n    </button>\n\n    <div class=\"pf-hop\" data-payload=\"7 probe results\"><div class=\"pf-rail\"></div>\n      <div class=\"pf-chip\">probes</div><div class=\"pf-hoplab\">7 results</div></div>\n\n    <button class=\"pf-node\" data-node=\"the signal\" data-in=\"7 probe results\" data-out=\"one evidence string\"\n            data-num=\"1 fires, 6 stay quiet\" data-state=\"running\" data-detail=\"#d-a2\">\n      <span class=\"pf-ix\">2</span><span class=\"pf-name\">the signal</span>\n      <span class=\"pf-recipe\"><i>in</i><span>7 probe results</span><i>out</i><span>one evidence string</span></span>\n      <span class=\"pf-num\">top 1 of 7 printed</span>\n    </button>\n\n    <div class=\"pf-hop\" data-payload=\"one evidence string\"><div class=\"pf-rail\"></div>\n      <div class=\"pf-chip\">evidence</div><div class=\"pf-hoplab\">evidence</div></div>\n\n    <button class=\"pf-node\" data-node=\"the ANGLE line\" data-in=\"one evidence string\" data-out=\"a named satellite + command\"\n            data-num=\"1 line per beat\" data-state=\"running\" data-detail=\"#d-a3\">\n      <span class=\"pf-ix\">3</span><span class=\"pf-name\">the ANGLE line</span>\n      <span class=\"pf-recipe\"><i>in</i><span>one evidence string</span><i>out</i><span>a satellite + command</span></span>\n      <span class=\"pf-num\">1 line per spine beat</span>\n    </button>\n\n    <div class=\"pf-hop\" data-payload=\"a named satellite + command\"><div class=\"pf-rail\"></div>\n      <div class=\"pf-chip\">/gabe-\u2026</div><div class=\"pf-hoplab\">a command</div></div>\n\n    <button class=\"pf-node\" data-node=\"the satellite\" data-in=\"a named satellite + command\" data-out=\"a finding, or nothing\"\n            data-num=\"15 manual-only skills\" data-state=\"unpowered\" data-detail=\"#d-a4\">\n      <span class=\"pf-ix\">4</span><span class=\"pf-name\">the satellite</span>\n      <span class=\"pf-recipe\"><i>in</i><span>a satellite + command</span><i>out</i><span>a finding, or nothing</span></span>\n      <span class=\"pf-num\">15 skills \u00b7 run by hand</span>\n      <span class=\"pf-alert\">\u26a0 operator-gated</span>\n    </button>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pf-gates\">\n    <span class=\"pf-gatelab\">gates</span>\n    <span class=\"pf-gate\" data-node=\"decay\" data-gate data-state=\"running\"\n          title=\"Offered twice on identical evidence and the signal is silenced \u2014 a true signal that becomes wallpaper stops being a signal.\">\n      decay \u00b7 silenced after 2 identical offers\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"pf-gate\" data-node=\"decay record\" data-gate data-state=\"ghost\"\n          title=\"The decay record lives at .kdbp/PULSE.jsonl. This repo has no .kdbp/, so nothing is remembered between runs here.\">\n      .kdbp/PULSE.jsonl \u00b7 absent in this repo\n    </span>\n  </div>\n</div></div></div></div>\n\n<div class=\"pf-legend\">\n  <span><i class=\"l-running\"></i> <b>running</b> \u2014 proven by the 18-case battery</span>\n  <span><i class=\"l-ghost\"></i> <b>ghost</b> \u2014 code exists, no store to write to here</span>\n  <span><i class=\"l-unpowered\"></i> <b>unpowered</b> \u2014 nothing makes the operator run it</span>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pf-details\">\n  <div class=\"pf-detail\" id=\"d-a1\">\n    <h4>repo state \u2014 seven probes, no judgement</h4>\n    <p>S1 adversarial \u00b7 S2 structural \u00b7 S3 journey proof \u00b7 S4 published docs \u00b7\n    S5 scope \u00b7 S6 entity context \u00b7 S7 explanation. Each is a deterministic read\n    of the tree; none of them decides anything.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"pf-detail\" id=\"d-a2\">\n    <h4>the signal \u2014 at most one is allowed to speak</h4>\n    <p>Every probe that fires carries its evidence. Only the top one is printed,\n    because a list of seven suggestions at the end of every beat is a list nobody\n    reads.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"pf-detail\" id=\"d-a3\">\n    <h4>the ANGLE line \u2014 one line, and it names the command</h4>\n    <p>The output is a single line naming which satellite would find something\n    right now and the exact command that runs it. Naming the command is the\n    point: a suggestion the reader has to translate is a suggestion they skip.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"pf-detail\" id=\"d-a4\">\n    <h4>the satellite \u2014 amber, because a human is the gate</h4>\n    <p>15 skills are manual-only. Nothing in this pipeline can run one; the line\n    can only make it visible. That is the honest ceiling of the design, and the\n    reason this machine is not green.</p>\n  </div>\n</div></div></div>"
  },
  "gastify-intake": {
   "title": "gastify \u00b7 the intake line",
   "note": "receipt photo \u2192 scan \u2192 draft \u2192 transaction \u00b7 numbers illustrative",
   "html": "<div class=\"pxfrag px-gastify-intake\" data-prism-fragment=\"gastify-intake\"><div class=\"pxhead\"><span class=\"pxtitle\">gastify \u00b7 the intake line</span><span class=\"pxnote\">receipt photo \u2192 scan \u2192 draft \u2192 transaction \u00b7 numbers illustrative</span></div><div class=\"pxbody\"><!-- FRAGMENT \u2014 the first half of gastify's scan\u2192cooked line, self-contained so\n     any doc page (here, or in gastify's center after propagation) can embed the\n     intake story alone. Numbers are ILLUSTRATIVE by operator ruling 2026-08-01;\n     the note above says so wherever this component lands. -->\n<div class=\"pfwrap\"><div class=\"pfsize\"><div class=\"pffit\"><div class=\"pf\" data-prism data-fx=\"gastify-intake\" data-tick=\"1400\">\n  <div class=\"pf-belt\">\n\n    <button class=\"pf-node\" data-node=\"receipt photo\" data-in=\"a supermarket receipt\" data-out=\"an image file\"\n            data-num=\"4 photos this week\" data-state=\"running\" data-detail=\"#d-gi1\">\n      <span class=\"pf-ix\">1</span><span class=\"pf-name\">receipt photo</span>\n      <span class=\"pf-recipe\"><i>in</i><span>a receipt</span><i>out</i><span>an image file</span></span>\n      <span class=\"pf-num\">4 photos this week</span>\n    </button>\n\n    <div class=\"pf-hop\" data-payload=\"an image file\"><div class=\"pf-rail\"></div>\n      <div class=\"pf-chip\">image</div><div class=\"pf-hoplab\">an image</div></div>\n\n    <button class=\"pf-node\" data-node=\"scan\" data-in=\"an image file\" data-out=\"raw line items\"\n            data-num=\"31 of 34 items parsed\" data-state=\"running\" data-detail=\"#d-gi2\">\n      <span class=\"pf-ix\">2</span><span class=\"pf-name\">scan</span>\n      <span class=\"pf-recipe\"><i>in</i><span>an image file</span><i>out</i><span>raw line items</span></span>\n      <span class=\"pf-num\">31 of 34 parsed</span>\n      <span class=\"pf-alert\">\u26a0 lossy</span>\n    </button>\n\n    <div class=\"pf-hop\" data-payload=\"raw line items\"><div class=\"pf-rail\"></div>\n      <div class=\"pf-chip\">items</div><div class=\"pf-hoplab\">line items</div></div>\n\n    <button class=\"pf-node\" data-node=\"draft\" data-in=\"raw line items\" data-out=\"a reviewable draft\"\n            data-num=\"26 auto-matched \u00b7 5 to review\" data-state=\"running\" data-detail=\"#d-gi3\">\n      <span class=\"pf-ix\">3</span><span class=\"pf-name\">draft</span>\n      <span class=\"pf-recipe\"><i>in</i><span>raw line items</span><i>out</i><span>a reviewable draft</span></span>\n      <span class=\"pf-num\">26 matched \u00b7 5 to review</span>\n    </button>\n\n    <div class=\"pf-hop\" data-payload=\"a reviewable draft\"><div class=\"pf-rail\"></div>\n      <div class=\"pf-chip\">draft</div><div class=\"pf-hoplab\">a draft</div></div>\n\n    <button class=\"pf-node\" data-node=\"transaction\" data-in=\"a reviewable draft\" data-out=\"a confirmed transaction\"\n            data-num=\"29 of 31 items confirmed\" data-state=\"running\" data-detail=\"#d-gi4\">\n      <span class=\"pf-ix\">4</span><span class=\"pf-name\">transaction</span>\n      <span class=\"pf-recipe\"><i>in</i><span>a draft</span><i>out</i><span>a confirmed transaction</span></span>\n      <span class=\"pf-num\">29 of 31 confirmed</span>\n    </button>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pf-gates\">\n    <span class=\"pf-gatelab\">gates</span>\n    <span class=\"pf-gate\" data-node=\"human confirm\" data-gate data-state=\"running\"\n          title=\"A draft becomes a transaction only when a person accepts it \u2014 nothing automatic crosses machine 4.\">\n      human confirm \u00b7 draft \u2192 transaction\n    </span>\n  </div>\n</div></div></div></div>\n\n<div class=\"pf-legend\">\n  <span><i class=\"l-running\"></i> <b>running</b> \u2014 in the line, moving material (numbers illustrative)</span>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pf-details\">\n  <div class=\"pf-detail\" id=\"d-gi1\"><h4>receipt photo</h4>\n    <p>The only machine with a physical input. Everything after it is data about\n    an object that no longer matters.</p>\n    <dl><dt>consumes</dt><dd>a supermarket receipt</dd><dt>produces</dt><dd>an image file</dd></dl></div>\n  <div class=\"pf-detail\" id=\"d-gi2\"><h4>scan \u2014 the lossy machine</h4>\n    <p>31 of 34 items is a 91% rate, and the three lost items never reach the\n    pantry \u2014 stock drifts low and a cookable recipe reads as un-cookable. The\n    most valuable measurement on the whole line is this machine's error rate.</p>\n    <dl><dt>consumes</dt><dd>an image file</dd><dt>produces</dt><dd>raw line items</dd>\n        <dt>fails by</dt><dd>silent misses \u2014 nothing downstream knows an item was dropped</dd></dl></div>\n  <div class=\"pf-detail\" id=\"d-gi3\"><h4>draft</h4>\n    <p>Where a raw string becomes a known product, or waits for a person. 5 human\n    decisions per receipt is the line's per-week attention price.</p>\n    <dl><dt>consumes</dt><dd>raw line items</dd><dt>produces</dt><dd>a reviewable draft</dd></dl></div>\n  <div class=\"pf-detail\" id=\"d-gi4\"><h4>transaction \u2014 the commit point</h4>\n    <p>Before it, everything is provisional; after it, stock has moved. The two\n    rejected items are the human catching what the matcher got wrong.</p>\n    <dl><dt>consumes</dt><dd>a reviewable draft</dd><dt>produces</dt><dd>a confirmed transaction \u2014 the kitchen loop's input</dd></dl></div>\n</div></div></div>"
  },
  "gastify-kitchen": {
   "title": "gastify \u00b7 the kitchen loop",
   "note": "pantry \u2192 recipe match \u2192 cooking \u2192 proficiency \u21ba \u00b7 numbers illustrative",
   "html": "<div class=\"pxfrag px-gastify-kitchen\" data-prism-fragment=\"gastify-kitchen\"><div class=\"pxhead\"><span class=\"pxtitle\">gastify \u00b7 the kitchen loop</span><span class=\"pxnote\">pantry \u2192 recipe match \u2192 cooking \u2192 proficiency \u21ba \u00b7 numbers illustrative</span></div><div class=\"pxbody\"><!-- FRAGMENT \u2014 the second half of gastify's line: the standing state, the side\n     input, the two human gates and the feedback edge. Self-contained for the\n     same reason as the intake fragment; the loop is the part worth reusing\n     wherever feedback needs explaining. Numbers ILLUSTRATIVE (ruling 2026-08-01). -->\n<div class=\"pfwrap\"><div class=\"pfsize\"><div class=\"pffit\"><div class=\"pf\" data-prism data-fx=\"gastify-kitchen\" data-tick=\"1400\">\n  <div class=\"pf-belt\">\n\n    <button class=\"pf-node\" data-node=\"pantry stock\" data-in=\"a confirmed transaction\" data-out=\"on-hand quantities\"\n            data-num=\"87 products on hand\" data-state=\"running\" data-detail=\"#d-gk1\">\n      <span class=\"pf-ix\">5</span><span class=\"pf-name\">pantry stock</span>\n      <span class=\"pf-recipe\"><i>in</i><span>a confirmed transaction</span><i>out</i><span>on-hand quantities</span></span>\n      <span class=\"pf-num\">87 products on hand</span>\n    </button>\n\n    <div class=\"pf-hop\" data-payload=\"on-hand quantities\"><div class=\"pf-rail\"></div>\n      <div class=\"pf-chip\">on hand</div><div class=\"pf-hoplab\">on-hand</div></div>\n\n    <button class=\"pf-node\" data-node=\"recipe match\" data-in=\"on-hand quantities\" data-out=\"cookable recipes\"\n            data-num=\"12 cookable of 68 known\" data-state=\"running\" data-detail=\"#d-gk2\">\n      <span class=\"pf-ix\">6</span><span class=\"pf-name\">recipe match</span>\n      <span class=\"pf-recipe\"><i>in</i><span>on-hand quantities</span><i>out</i><span>cookable recipes</span></span>\n      <span class=\"pf-num\">12 cookable of 68</span>\n      <span class=\"pf-alert\">\u26a0 side input</span>\n    </button>\n\n    <div class=\"pf-hop\" data-payload=\"cookable recipes\"><div class=\"pf-rail\"></div>\n      <div class=\"pf-chip\">cookable</div><div class=\"pf-hoplab\">cookable</div></div>\n\n    <button class=\"pf-node\" data-node=\"cooking event\" data-in=\"cookable recipes\" data-out=\"consumed stock + a log entry\"\n            data-num=\"5 cooked of 12 offered\" data-state=\"running\" data-detail=\"#d-gk3\">\n      <span class=\"pf-ix\">7</span><span class=\"pf-name\">cooking event</span>\n      <span class=\"pf-recipe\"><i>in</i><span>cookable recipes</span><i>out</i><span>stock used + a log</span></span>\n      <span class=\"pf-num\">5 cooked of 12 offered</span>\n    </button>\n\n    <div class=\"pf-hop\" data-payload=\"consumed stock + a log entry\"><div class=\"pf-rail\"></div>\n      <div class=\"pf-chip\">log</div><div class=\"pf-hoplab\">a log entry</div></div>\n\n    <button class=\"pf-node\" data-node=\"proficiency\" data-in=\"consumed stock + a log entry\" data-out=\"a skill score \u21ba 6\"\n            data-num=\"41 events \u00b7 3 levels\" data-state=\"running\" data-detail=\"#d-gk4\">\n      <span class=\"pf-ix\">8</span><span class=\"pf-name\">proficiency</span>\n      <span class=\"pf-recipe\"><i>in</i><span>a log entry</span><i>out</i><span>a skill score \u21ba 6</span></span>\n      <span class=\"pf-num\">41 events \u00b7 3 levels</span>\n    </button>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pf-gates\">\n    <span class=\"pf-gatelab\">gates</span>\n    <span class=\"pf-gate\" data-node=\"bought-to-cookable notice\" data-gate data-state=\"ghost\"\n          title=\"Flow 3 (bought \u2192 cookable notification) is recorded as NOT BUILT \u2014 a named gap, not a zero.\">\n      bought \u2192 cookable notification \u00b7 NOT BUILT\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"pf-gate\" data-node=\"stock floor\" data-gate data-state=\"unpowered\"\n          title=\"Stock should never go negative; no test proves anything stops it.\">\n      stock \u2265 0 \u00b7 nothing proves it\n    </span>\n  </div>\n</div></div></div></div>\n\n<div class=\"pf-legend\">\n  <span><i class=\"l-running\"></i> <b>running</b> \u2014 in the line, moving material (numbers illustrative)</span>\n  <span><i class=\"l-ghost\"></i> <b>ghost</b> \u2014 not built: Flow 3 is a recorded, named gap</span>\n  <span><i class=\"l-unpowered\"></i> <b>unpowered</b> \u2014 exists, and nothing proves it can fail</span>\n  <span><i class=\"l-broken\"></i> <b>broken</b> \u2014 would report success it did not earn (none here)</span>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pf-details\">\n  <div class=\"pf-detail\" id=\"d-gk1\"><h4>pantry stock \u2014 the only standing state</h4>\n    <p>Every other machine is a flow; this one persists. An error upstream does\n    not pass through it \u2014 it <em>accumulates</em> in it, which is why the intake\n    scan's misses matter more here than anywhere else.</p>\n    <dl><dt>consumes</dt><dd>a confirmed transaction \u2014 the intake line's output</dd>\n        <dt>produces</dt><dd>on-hand quantities</dd></dl></div>\n  <div class=\"pf-detail\" id=\"d-gk2\"><h4>recipe match \u2014 the side input</h4>\n    <p>This machine consumes two things: the pantry that came down the belt, and\n    the 68-recipe catalogue that never did. Drawing that as one inbound arrow\n    would be the lie this grammar exists to avoid. 12 cookable of 68 known is\n    the household's real menu tonight.</p>\n    <dl><dt>consumes</dt><dd>on-hand quantities + the recipe catalogue (side)</dd>\n        <dt>produces</dt><dd>cookable recipes</dd></dl></div>\n  <div class=\"pf-detail\" id=\"d-gk3\"><h4>cooking event \u2014 the second human gate</h4>\n    <p>5 cooked of 12 offered: the line's narrowest voluntary funnel. Nothing\n    automatic reaches proficiency \u2014 a person has to actually cook.</p>\n    <dl><dt>consumes</dt><dd>cookable recipes</dd><dt>produces</dt><dd>consumed stock + a log entry</dd></dl></div>\n  <div class=\"pf-detail\" id=\"d-gk4\"><h4>proficiency \u2014 and the loop</h4>\n    <p>41 logged events across 3 skill levels, and the output returns to\n    machine&nbsp;6: what you have cooked changes what you are offered. That\n    feedback edge is why this is a loop and not a funnel \u2014 and the part a linear\n    diagram of the same boxes silently drops.</p>\n    <dl><dt>consumes</dt><dd>consumed stock + a log entry</dd>\n        <dt>produces</dt><dd>a skill score, fed back to recipe match</dd></dl></div>\n</div></div></div>"
  }
 }
}
